SUMMARY:40% off The Parfumerie + Pre-Dinner + Post Dessert at The Distille
 ry District
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: This new Black Friday sale starts 
 Nov 27th and will be in effect on performance day\; limited seats remainin
 g. Theatre tickets allow free and skip-the-line entry into The Distillery 
 District for this show.**\n\n**On Saturday\, November 28th\, see** **The P
 arfumerie at The Distillery District**. On a snowy night in downtown Budap
 est\, a perfumery hums with chatter\, gossip\, and the spark of romance. B
 ehind elegant counters\, clerks scramble through the holiday rush as a sec
 ret love ignites.Tender\, sharp\, and riotously funny: *Parfumerie* is a r
 omantic comedy about yearning\, connection\, and the leap of faith love de
 mands. My seat is Balcony AA9. **Purchase The Parfumerie on Saturday\, Nov
 ember 28th at 7pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $115/$135\n\nSale: $73.50/$93.5
 0 with code WEEKENDBOGO\n\nRush: It there are any\, they will be available
  online at 8:00 AM that morning from $32 -$40 with [code](26RUSH26)\n\nMee
 tup Organizer Fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: All sales are final.\n\n**SIGNING-
 UP**\n\n* **RSVP\, confirming if you will join for dinner before\, as rese
 rvations are required**\n* **[Purchase](https://my.soulpepper.ca/16064/161
 72) your own ticket for Saturday November 28th at 7pm using discount code 
 BLACKFRIDAY40\, and post your seat number in the Comment section. I will t
 hen move you to attending.**\n* Members can also show up at the Theatre wi
 th their ticket in hand.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior and cancellations may
  result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\nA reminder will be s
 ent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and whe
 n.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for Dinner at: 5:15pm in front of Restaur
 ant** **TBC** (I can only make the reservation 2 weeks prior)\n\n**Meet me
  for the show at: 6:45pm in the line for the Baillie Theatre inside the Yo
 ung Centre for the Performing Arts in the Distillery District at 50 Tankho
 use Lane**\n\n**Show Starts**: **7pm**\n\nLength: estimate 2 hours\n\n**Af
 ter: meet at the same spot to chat about the show/ head out for a beverage
 /dessert across the street**\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the
  Event after.
