SUMMARY:Holiday Dinner at Michelin Recommended Restaurant Bar Eugenie (Har
 bord St)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Sunday\, December 6th\, join us for O
 ur Holiday Dinner at 2026 Michelin Recommended Bar Eugenie.** The team beh
 ind this addition to Harbord Street’s increasingly epic food scene met w
 hile working for the Alo Food Group. Bar Eugenie is an ingredient-driven r
 estaurant and bar that brings global flavours to the heart of Harbord Vill
 age. Their cozy\, lively space is made for gathering—whether around our 
 bar or at one of their intimately set tables. This neighborhood restaurant
  pays homage to Eugénie Brazier\, the legendary French chef often referre
 d to as the "mother of French cooking" and the first person to earn six Mi
 chelin Stars in 1933 (three each at two different restaurants). It's a nei
 ghborhood spot\, where the food and atmosphere are meant to be enjoyed\, w
 hile the menu leans classic and comforting while remaining firmly ingredie
 nt focused. We'll dress up for our Holiday Dinner.\n\n**COST**\nOrganizer 
 Meetup fee: $5\n\nAn etransfer of $35 (includes $5 meetup fee) is required
  to reserve your spot\, as I have provided my credit card for the reservat
 ion.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes. Everyone goes on the waitlist until 
 they have reserved their seat\, with an etransfer of $35 (includes $5 meet
 up fee). Attendees will receive back $30 by etransfer the day after the ev
 ent.\n* Once you are on the waitlist\, I will message you the email addres
 s for the etransfer.\n* Once the transfer is complete\, I will move you to
  attending. There are no refunds for any reason\, especially as this is th
 e Holiday season.\n* It is recommended you sign up early\, as it is highly
  unlikely I will be able to update the reservation closer to the event dat
 e.\n* A reminder will be sent the night before with my cell and all meetup
  details. Make sure you set up your communication settings to receive.\n\n
 RSVPs close Tuesday of that week\, or when full. Cancellations will result
  in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me 
 at: 5:15pm inside the front doors of Bar Eugenie at 89 Harbord St.** Pleas
 e wait for me to arrive\, and do not get seated prior\, as I have requeste
 d a specific table.\n\nLength: 2.25 hours\n\nEnjoy and please post your Co
 mments in the event after.
