SUMMARY:Holiday Pops Concert at The Toronto Symphony + Pre-Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: I am posting this now as Orchestra a
 nd Mezzanine are almost sold out.\n\nOn **Wednesday December 9th\, celebra
 te the Holidays with Natalie MacMaster\, Donnell Leahy\, and the MacMaster
  Leahy Family.** Start the Holiday season with a Celtic twist as the TSO w
 elcomes Canadian fiddling icons. I had the pleasure of seeing them here ma
 ny years ago\, and the program had each child join one by one. It was incr
 edible and touching entertainment\, and by intermission\, I was in tears. 
 I hope you will join me for festive favourites alongside Celtic classics\,
  with spirited reels and jigs to beloved carols. Gather your loved ones fo
 r toe-tapping cheer\, timeless holiday melodies\, and a joyful singalong t
 hat will leave hearts light and spirits bright for the season ahead. As a 
 subscriber\, I can buy additional seats at the subscriber price for attend
 ees - just message me. My seat is Orchestra Left Parterre A8. **Purchase y
 our tickets for Holiday Pops: A Celtic Celebration on Wednesday December 9
 th at 7:30pm**.\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $64 - 167 includes taxes and fees\n\
 nRush: A limited number of tickets may go on sale at 1pm online\, over the
  phone\, or in-person at Roy Thomson Hall. Limit 2 per person based on ava
 ilability.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-ref
 undable.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes (everyone goes on
  the wailist until they post their seat number)**\n* **[Purchase](https://
 my.tso.ca/4043/4045) your ticket for Wed. Dec. 9th @ 7:30pm\, post your se
 at number and I will move you to attending.**\n* If you plan to buy RUSH\,
  please state that in your RSVP\, so I can include you in the reminder and
  we can meet you.\n* RSVPs close 2 days prior\, and cancellations after wi
 ll result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will go
  out the day before with my cell and details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐
 ----‐----‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me f
 or dinner at: 5:45pm at Moxies\, 100 University Ave.**\n\n**Meet me for th
 e show at: 7:15pm** **at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe St.\, inside the so
 uthern-most double set of glass doors\, after scanning your tickets.**\n\n
 **Start time: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours (includes intermission)\n\nEnjoy
  and please post your Comments after!
