SUMMARY:Virtual: Vivaldi and Mozart at The Louvre (Paris)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday December 26th\,** **see Viva
 ldi and Mozart at The Louvre.** Julien Chauvin and the Concert de la Loge 
 celebrate Vivaldi and Mozart in the famous Cour Marly at the Musée du Lou
 vre. This lovely concert features mezzo-soprano Marina Viotti and violist 
 Amihai Grosz amidst the sublime statues populating the inner courtyard. No
 te: This is only available to view in Canada.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNI
 NG UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **Start time: At 7pm\, click on [this link
 ](https://www.knowledge.ca/program/vivaldi-and-mozart-at-the-louvre)** and
  log in\, as we have used this platform several times over the years. You 
 may need to reset your password or sign up for a free new account.\n* Leng
 th: 1 hour 3 mins\n* RSVPs close 1 hour prior to start time\n*\n\nEnjoy an
 d please post your Comments after!
